'''Deadly Carnival II''' (極ムズカーニバル2!, ''Goku Muzukānibaru2!'', '''Extreme Carnival 2!''') is a special event-chapter that  was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and first appeared during the 25 Million Downloads/2nd Anniversary Event. The first stage contains [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s and drops 2 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]] when cleared for the first time, while the second features enemy [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] from the [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]] and drops 1 Rare Cat Ticket on first completion.

